---
source: src/args.rs
expression: help
---
Usage: arkivisto [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  scan
          Scan documents in a loop
  process
          Process scanned documents (post-process TIFFs and run OCR)
  archive
          Archive processed documents
  single
          Scan, process and archive a single document
  init-config
          Initialize the configuration file
  help
          Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -l, --log-level <LOG_LEVEL>
          Log level [default: info] [possible values: trace, debug, info, warn, error]
      --fake-scan
          Dev mode: Don't actually scan, but use simulated scan TIFFs
  -h, --help
          Print help
  -V, --version
          Print version
